  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sFx7o7p.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1158094?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=Curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/deimos?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>Deimos 是一款用於數據生成與配置的 Minecraft 函式庫。使用它，您可以在 Forge 和 Neoforge 上原生生成設定檔並在遊戲內顯示，或在 Fabric 平台上借助 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> 來實現。Deimos 允許您在遊戲啟動時建立新的合成配方，從而使其可配置。這也意味著您無需依賴 JSON 檔案，切換 Minecraft 版本將變得更加輕鬆簡便。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本函式庫的配置部分基於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightLib</a>（由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/motschen/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Motschen</a> 開發）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我製作此模組是為了簡化開發流程，並讓我在所有模組載入器與 Minecraft 版本中都能統一使用同一套配置函式庫。如果您想查看實際應用案例，歡迎瀏覽我正在積極開發的其他模組：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/laser-bridges-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1195/185/64/64/638770736607588151_animated.gif\" alt=\"雷射橋樑與門\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1821/680/64/64/639150887771985409.png\" alt=\"願望配方\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-mc-music-discs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/369/955/64/64/637539954760044673.png\" alt=\"更多音樂唱片\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sever-side-horror\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1380/4/64/64/638895109610009518.png\" alt=\"伺服器端驚悚\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exp-counter-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1179/179/64/64/638752204531779528.png\" alt=\"經驗值計數器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fire-arrows-start-fire\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSoi1ek.png\" alt=\"火焰箭引發火災\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flat-exp-costs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1314/641/64/64/638854870713185428.png\" alt=\"固定經驗消耗\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lava-turns-sand-into-glass-fabric-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1179/182/64/64/638752210189574617.png\" alt=\"熔岩將沙子轉化為玻璃\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cooked-carrots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tFPjbhV.png\" alt=\"熟蘿蔔\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/husks-drop-sand\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/376/68/64/64/637552001848895633.png\" alt=\"屍殼掉落沙子\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果您是對此函式庫感興趣的開發者，歡迎前往其 <a href=\"https://github.com/Mars-The-Planet/Deimos\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 頁面查看詳細的安裝與使用說明。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
